                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "its... interesting. does what it says, i suppose... but really could use a bit more polish. for example, sound is either on or off, same for music. also, some of the interface elements are poorly placed, especially the 'return to menu' element, which is so far away i risk punching my monitor to hit it.\n\nthere really needs to be a way to move the table around AFTER you have started a game. i can recenter the view, but not move the table, or rather if i can, i cant figure out how to do it.\n\nbut, if you want to play solitaire in vr, this is the only game in town, and it does it reasonably well, so its hard to go wrong for two bucks.",
